# Trusted Sunstone release signing keys, in ssh-keygen "allowed signers"
# format (see ssh-keygen(1), ALLOWED SIGNERS). The package installs this file
# as /opt/sunstone/share/release-signers, and `sunstone self-update` checks
# SHA256SUMS.sig against it before installing anything.
#
# Both the principal and the namespace are "sunstone-release", so a vakr
# release signature can never pass for a Sunstone one. To rotate, add the new
# key here and publish that release signed with the old key; remove the old
# key in a later release.
